      "number": "88",
      "source_number": "88",
      "group": null,
      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "88. 确定下列方程的次数：\na) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；\nb) $5x-6y-14=0$；\nc) $x^3-5x^2y^4+y^5-8y^3=0$；\nd) $x^2-5x^3y+y^4-1=0$；\ne) $x-xy=65$；\nf) $x^4-8x^2y^3+y^4=16$；\ng) $3xy=x(y+1)-5y$；\nh) $7x^8-12xy+y=7x^2(x^6+1)$。",
      "lines": [
        "88. 确定下列方程的次数：",
        "a) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；",
